#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:2
msgid "Connect a storage adapter"
msgstr "接入存储适配器"

#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:4
msgid "Wrap an existing storage backend to record persistence operations, while letting the persistence extension manage conversation history."
msgstr "包装一个已有的存储后端，以记录持久化操作，同时让持久化扩展管理对话历史记录。"

#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:8
msgid "Run it"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:10
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录下执行："

#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:16
msgid "The output includes:"
msgstr "输出包含："

#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:22
msgid "This program uses deterministic offline models and temporary storage where needed. It requires no API key and is executed by the documentation test suite."
msgstr "这个程序在需要时使用确定性的离线模型和临时存储。它不需要 API 密钥，并由文档测试套件执行。"

#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:26
msgid "Adapt the store, not the agent loop"
msgstr "适配存储，而不是智能体循环"

#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:28
msgid "``AuditedStorage`` delegates reads and writes to SQLite while recording their order. The extension only needs to construct that adapter:"
msgstr "``AuditedStorage`` 把读写委托给 SQLite，同时记录它们的顺序。扩展只需要构造这个适配器："

#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:35
msgid "The complete source implements the storage methods for loading history, appending messages, and saving a compaction checkpoint. If you replace SQLite with another database, preserve sequence ordering, transactions, and version checks; those guarantees matter when restoring a conversation safely."
msgstr "完整源码实现了加载历史记录、追加消息和保存压缩检查点所需的存储方法。如果你用其他数据库替换 SQLite，请保留顺序、事务和版本校验；这些保证在安全恢复对话时很重要。"

#: ../../examples/storage-adapter.rst:41
msgid "Complete source"
msgstr "完整源码"

